# private/ — OUR working space, never published (added 2026-08-20).
#
# For durable work-product we do not want public: post-launch maintenance
# plans, ops notes, anything commercially or operationally sensitive.
#
# How this differs from its two neighbours, so things land in the right place:
#   handoffs/  — EPHEMERAL session continuity. Superseded every session.
#   planning/  — TRACKED on purpose: the tracker cites planning/reports/... as
#                evidence in ~148 places, and untracking it would turn every
#                one of those into a dead link.
#   private/   — durable, ours, and deliberately not in the repo.
private/
